ArenaControls.jsx:
  Props: { onMute, onVideoToggle, onEndSession, isMuted, isVideoOff }
  Layout: centered pill-shaped dock, fixed to bottom of arena
  Mute button: mic icon, toggles red when muted
  Video button: camera icon, toggles red when off
  End Session: red button, opens confirmation modal before firing

SimulationArena.jsx (THE HARDEST VIEW):
  Layout: 50/50 horizontal split, pure black bg-black
  Left: user webcam via navigator.mediaDevices.getUserMedia
  Right: AvatarView.jsx with sme_agent_id OR evaluator_agent_id
  Bottom: ArenaControls.jsx floating dock
  Guard: if no session_token in context → redirect to /
