Success toasts (green):
  "Document parsed successfully"
  "Panel initialized"
  "Session saved"

Error toasts (red):
  "Analysis failed. Try a smaller PDF."
  "Agent creation failed. Check API key."
  "Connection lost. Returning to lobby."

